===Etymology===
1768; from {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|oriol}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|oriol}}, from {{etyl|pro|en}} {{m|pro|auriol}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} ''[[aureolus]]'', diminutive of {{m|la|aureus||golden}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|/ˈɔɹiəl/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various colourful [[passerine]] [[bird]]s, the [[New World]] orioles from the family ''[[Icteridae]]'' and the [[Old World]] orioles from the family ''[[Oriolidae]]''.

